      "text": "To determine the cost of the painting in Chinese yuan, we need to convert the cost from Namibian dollars to US dollars and then from US dollars to Chinese yuan. Here are the steps in detail:\n\n1. **Convert Namibian dollars to US dollars:**\n   The exchange rate given is 1 US dollar = 7 Namibian dollars.\n   Therefore, to find out how many US dollars 105 Namibian dollars is, we divide 105 by 7:\n   \\[\n   \\text{US dollars} = \\frac{105 \\text{ Namibian dollars}}{7 \\text{ Namibian dollars/US dollar}} = 15 \\text{ US dollars}\n   \\]\n\n2. **Convert US dollars to Chinese yuan:**\n   The exchange rate given is 1 US dollar = 6 Chinese yuan.\n   Therefore, to find out how many Chinese yuan 15 US dollars is, we multiply 15 by 6:\n   \\[\n   \\text{Chinese yuan} = 15 \\text{ US dollars} \\times 6 \\text{ Chinese yuan/US dollar} = 90 \\text{ Chinese yuan}\n   \\]\n\nSo, the cost of the painting in Chinese yuan is \\(\\boxed{90}\\).",
